      "writtenOn": "2022-01-20T22:36:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "rather than nesting this in config, we can export more variables in our file, for example, how we\u0027re handling Soong config variables: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/soongconfig/modules.go;l\u003d303;drc\u003d4ad40d99b08022f532d2eb2e5a4d66b3e3f6c20f\n\nconfig is based on the current lunch target, whereas _product_variables and _arch_variant_product_variables and should vary less, separating it should help distinguish the use cases better.",
