      "message": "What would a better name for the new output field (what were previously hardcoded _product_variables) be? Or, should I rename the variables that are currently output in soong_injection/product_config/product_variables.bzl to something more like config_vars?\n\nSince the big list from Soong config and the list of hardcoded _product_variables in product_variables/constants.bzl are both called \"product variables\", I\u0027m not sure how to distinguish the two concepts.",
